contentText:
After some people grumbled about Travis Kelce &#8216;s viral beer chug while sitting courtside with Taylor Swift at the NBA Eastern Conference Finals, the Kansas City Chiefs tight end proved that he&#8217;s shaking it off on the Wednesday (May 27) episode of New Heights .

